<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Dashboard — Observatoire du Marché Immobilier</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Dashboard de visualisation des données de l'Observatoire du Marché Immobilier." />

  <!-- Leaflet -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />

  <!-- Chart.js -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0f766e;
      --primary-dark: #115e59;
      --secondary: #f59e0b;
      --bg: #f3f4f6;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --text: #111827;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --border: #d1d5db;
      --success: #15803d;
      --danger: #b91c1c;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);
      --radius: 18px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark), var(--primary));
      color: white;
      padding: 24px 16px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom-left-radius: 28px;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: #d1fae5;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .top-links {
      margin-top: 14px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .top-links a,
    .top-links button {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      color: white;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      font-weight: 750;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: -16px auto 36px;
      padding: 0 14px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .section-title {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .status {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-weight: 750;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .status.loading {
      background: #fef3c7;
      color: #92400e;
      border: 1px solid #fcd34d;
    }

    .status.success {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
      border: 1px solid #86efac;
    }

    .status.error {
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
      border: 1px solid #fca5a5;
    }

    .filters {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      color: #374151;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    select,
    input {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 46px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 11px 12px;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      outline: none;
      background: white;
    }

    select:focus,
    input:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.14);
    }

    .kpis {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .kpi {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .kpi .label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .kpi .value {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 1.42rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .charts {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .chart-box {
      min-height: 320px;
    }

    .chart-container {
      height: 270px;
      position: relative;
    }

    canvas {
      width: 100% !important;
      height: 100% !important;
    }


    .leaflet-control-layers {
      border-radius: 12px !important;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18) !important;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .leaflet-control-layers-expanded {
      padding: 8px 10px;
    }

    #map {
      height: 420px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #e5e7eb;
    }


    .map-tools {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f9fafb;
    }

    .map-tools .tool {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .map-note {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .map-stats {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 10px 0 0;
    }

    .map-stat {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      border: 1px solid #99f6e4;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    @media (min-width: 720px) {
      .map-tools {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        align-items: end;
      }
    }

    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 980px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    th,
    td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      text-align: left;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    th {
      background: var(--primary-dark);
      color: white;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f9fafb; }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }


    .photo-mini-list {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .photo-mini {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      border: 1px solid #99f6e4;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .popup-photos {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding-top: 8px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .popup-photos-title {
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .popup-photo-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(80px, 1fr));
      gap: 6px;
      max-width: 240px;
    }

    .popup-photo-grid a {
      display: block;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
      background: #f9fafb;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .photo-count-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fff7ed;
      color: #9a3412;
      border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .creator-link {
      color: inherit;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }


    .access-screen {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark), var(--primary));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 18px;
      z-index: 99999;
    }

    .access-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 26px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .access-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
    }

    .access-card p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #4b5563;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
    }

    .access-card input {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .access-card button {
      width: 100%;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .access-error {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
      border: 1px solid #fca5a5;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .access-small {
      margin-top: 12px !important;
      color: var(--muted) !important;
      font-size: 0.78rem !important;
    }

    .logout-dashboard {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      color: white;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      font-weight: 750;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      padding: 0 16px 28px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (min-width: 720px) {
      header h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; }
      .filters { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
      .charts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1040px) {
      .filters { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); }
      .kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); }
    }

    /* ===== Design moderne ===== */
    body {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15,118,110,0.14), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(245,158,11,0.13), transparent 28%),
        var(--bg);
    }

    header {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding-top: 30px;
    }

    header::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -120px auto auto 50%;
      width: 420px;
      height: 420px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      filter: blur(1px);
    }

    header h1,
    header p,
    .top-links {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .top-links a,
    .top-links button {
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.13);
      transition: transform .15s ease, background .15s ease;
    }

    .top-links a:hover,
    .top-links button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.20);
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .section-title {
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .kpi {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
    }

    .kpi:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12);
    }

    .kpi .value {
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .chart-box {
      border: 1px solid rgba(209, 213, 219, 0.75);
    }

    .map-tools {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f9fafb);
    }

    #map {
      min-height: 460px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    }

    .heat-legend {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .heat-gradient {
      width: 170px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(14,165,233,0.25), rgba(34,197,94,0.55), rgba(245,158,11,0.70), rgba(239,68,68,0.85));
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .leaflet-marker-icon.default-point-marker {
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.22));
    }

    .leaflet-interactive.heat-circle {
      filter: blur(0.2px);
    }

    .export-note {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      #map { min-height: 390px; }
      .top-links { gap: 8px; }
      .top-links a, .top-links button { font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 8px 10px; }
    }


    /* ===== Améliorations analytiques : fiche, classes de prix, filtres avancés ===== */
    .advanced-filters {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .filter-group-title {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .btn-reset-filters {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      min-height: 46px;
      background: #e5e7eb;
      color: #111827;
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .map-legend-card {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
    }

    .legend-title {
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .price-legend {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #374151;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .legend-dot {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: inline-block;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.9), 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }

    .class-low { background: #16a34a; }
    .class-medium { background: #eab308; }
    .class-high { background: #f97316; }
    .class-very-high { background: #dc2626; }
    .class-unknown { background: #64748b; }

    .detail-panel {
      position: fixed;
      right: 18px;
      top: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: min(440px, calc(100vw - 36px));
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.98);
      border: 1px solid rgba(209,213,219,0.85);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
      z-index: 99998;
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .detail-panel.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    .detail-header {
      padding: 16px 16px 13px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark), var(--primary));
      color: white;
      position: relative;
    }

    .detail-header h2 {
      margin: 0 42px 5px 0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .detail-header p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #d1fae5;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .detail-close {
      position: absolute;
      right: 12px;
      top: 12px;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .detail-body {
      padding: 14px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .detail-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .detail-metric {
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #f9fafb;
    }

    .detail-metric .name {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .detail-metric .val {
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-weight: 950;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.25;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .detail-section {
      margin: 14px 0;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .detail-section h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      font-size: 0.94rem;
    }

    .detail-line {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
    }

    .detail-line strong {
      color: #374151;
    }

    .detail-photos {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .detail-photo-link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      border: 1px solid #99f6e4;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
    }

    .territory-summary {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .territory-table {
      min-width: 1080px;
    }

    .row-clickable {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .row-clickable:hover td {
      background: #ecfdf5 !important;
    }

    @media (min-width: 720px) {
      .advanced-filters {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      }

      .territory-summary {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .detail-panel {
        left: 10px;
        right: 10px;
        top: 10px;
        bottom: 10px;
        width: auto;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .detail-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .detail-line {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

  </style>
</head>

<body>


<div id="accessScreen" class="access-screen">
  <div class="access-card">
    <h2>Accès réservé</h2>
    <p>
      Ce dashboard contient les résultats et les analyses de l’Observatoire du Marché Immobilier.
      Veuillez saisir le code d’accès.
    </p>

    <input
      type="password"
      id="accessCodeInput"
      placeholder="Code d’accès"
      autocomplete="off"
      inputmode="text"
    />

    <button type="button" onclick="checkDashboardAccess()">
      Accéder au dashboard
    </button>

    <div id="accessError" class="access-error">
      Code incorrect. Veuillez réessayer.
    </div>

    <p class="access-small">
      Observatoire du Marché Immobilier — Accès administrateur
    </p>
  </div>
</div>


<header>
  <h1>Dashboard — Observatoire du Marché Immobilier</h1>
  <p>Visualisation automatique des biens collectés sur le terrain</p>

  <div class="top-links">
    <a href="./index.html">← Retour à l’application</a>
    <button type="button" onclick="loadData()">↻ Actualiser</button>
    <button type="button" class="logout-dashboard" onclick="logoutDashboard()">🔒 Verrouiller</button>
    <button type="button" onclick="exportFilteredJson()">⬇ Export JSON</button>
    <button type="button" onclick="exportFilteredCsv()">⬇ Export CSV</button>
    <button type="button" onclick="exportFilteredGeoJson()">⬇ Export GeoJSON</button>
    <a href="https://brahimjaziri.jimdofree.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Brahim Jaziri</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <div id="status" class="status loading">
    Chargement des données depuis Google Sheets...
  </div>

  <section class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">🔎 Filtres</h2>

    <div class="filters">
      <div>
        <label for="filterGouvernorat">Gouvernorat</label>
        <select id="filterGouvernorat"></select>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="filterType">Type de bien</label>
        <select id="filterType"></select>
      </div>

      <div>
